-       `time.show` renders it with the `Clockface.Format`, `Numerics`, `Separation` and
-       `Specificity` in scope — four givens, bundled by each of the `timeFormats` givens
-       (`militaryTimeFormat` for `1430`, `civilianTimeFormat` for `02:30 PM`) or imported
-       singly from `hourFormats`, `timeNumerics`, `timeSeparators` and `timeSpecificities`. A
-       `Horology` adds hours, minutes or seconds to a clockface, wrapping at midnight.
+       `time.show` lo representa con los `Clockface.Format`, `Numerics`, `Separation` y
+       `Specificity` del ámbito: cuatro givens, que agrupa cada uno de los givens de
+       `timeFormats` (`militaryTimeFormat` para `1430`, `civilianTimeFormat` para `02:30 PM`) o
+       que se importan por separado de `hourFormats`, `timeNumerics`, `timeSeparators` y
+       `timeSpecificities`. Un `Horology` suma horas, minutos o segundos a un clockface, dando la
+       vuelta a medianoche.

